


Zotuluka lembani: ['Number:'].
>> a := Nambala + Nambala + 1.
a := Nambala - 2.
a := Nambala × 2.
a := Nambala ÷ 2.
Zotuluka lembani: a.
Zotuluka mzere-watsopano.

Zotuluka lembani: ['String:'].
Zotuluka lembani: Malemba kutalika.
Zotuluka mzere-watsopano.

Zotuluka lembani: ['File:'].
Zotuluka lembani: Fayilo werengani.
Zotuluka lembani: (Fayilo lembani: ['test']).
Zotuluka lembani: (Fayilo onjeza-kumapeto: ['test']).
Zotuluka lembani: Fayilo chotsani.
Zotuluka lembani: Fayilo lilipo.
Zotuluka lembani: Fayilo include.
Zotuluka lembani: Fayilo yamba.
Zotuluka mzere-watsopano.


Zotuluka lembani: ['Array:'].
Zotuluka lembani: Mndandanda tenga-chomaliza.
Zotuluka lembani: Mndandanda chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
Zotuluka lembani: (((Mndandanda onjeza-kumapeto: 999) malemba-a-mawu) sinthani: ['Lĳst'] ndi: ['List']).
Zotuluka lembani: Mndandanda chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
Zotuluka lembani: Mndandanda tenga-choyamba.
Zotuluka lembani: (Mndandanda lumikiza: [',']).
>> f := Mndandanda chatsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: f chiwerengero-cha-zinthu. 
Zotuluka mzere-watsopano.

Zotuluka lembani: ['Map:'].
Zotuluka lembani: Mtanthauziramawu chiwerengero-cha-zinthu.
Zotuluka lembani: (Mtanthauziramawu ikani: ['a'] pa: ['b'])  chiwerengero-cha-zinthu. 
Zotuluka mzere-watsopano.




